|YKBtutorial continue|YKO to continue in any client.

Learn to look at everything (|YKBxa <thing>|YKO), check your
|YKBinventory|YKO, and read your |YKBscore|YKO. If you ever get lost,
|YKBncot|YKO returns you to the Center of Town, and the Newbie Tome
Dispenser there (|YKBpull lever|YKO, |YKBread tome|YKO) holds the town
directions.|XX0

